# Slide 5: Product Workflow

TRACOM enables institutions to issue verifiable credentials through a simple workflow.

1. Institution creates learning content.
2. Learner enrolls in a course.
3. Learner completes course requirements.
4. Credential is issued.
5. Credential can be verified independently using Cardano.

The current submission demonstrates the complete application workflow and production deployment.

